        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Relates to coprecipitation of ITO from a raw aqueous solution and subsequent calcination. The raw solution can be prepared from both pure metals as well as from spent targets.\n\n# Included processes\nElectricity and heat demand for precipitation; recovery of spent ITO targets,</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
